T:Greenhaugh Farm
% NFF Book 2026, compiled by Ray Mulligan
C:Bob Ballantine, (1928-2014)
S:from the playing of Bob Ballantine (1928-2014)
H:Bob Ballantine composed this while travelling to and from the Blue Streak
H:Rocket testing at the Woomera Test Range in the 1960s. It became a
H:closing piece of his gigs at festivals and was recorded on his CD.
